{"id":"u-90680726-76a0-4359-a4bb-9b100c8a520c","src":"community","title":"Full Body - compound focus for a busy Dad","author":"Jonathan H.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/m2BksE-full-body-compound-focus-for-a-busy-dad","desc":"Inspired by the one and only Brandon Carter. Designed for busy dads, this 6-week full-body workout program maximizes your time with a focus on compound movements and then one optional accessory day. With 18 training sessions (at least), you'll engage multiple muscle groups efficiently, building strength and endurance without sacrificing family time. \n\nThis is one I built for myself as I like following along in this app and don’t like swapping too much when using other people’s routine. I do cardio outside of this. Uploaded just in case anyone wants it.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-13T16:00:56.501Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full Body - 1","Full Body - 2","Full Body - 3","Short Accessory Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":6},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":6.5},{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8.5},{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8.5}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":6.5},{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8.5}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":6.5},{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8.5},{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8.5}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8},{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":9}]}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":6.5},{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8},{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9}],"note":"Do this on the diverging pulldown machine if possible"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Military Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":6.5},{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8},{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":9}],"note":"Control it on way down as much as possible. Use legs if need extra push"},